    "body": "[20.5.1.1 `Error` constructor](https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/fundamental-objects.html#sec-error-message) -> [20.5.8.1 InstallErrorCause](https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/fundamental-objects.html#sec-installerrorcause).\r\nIt's not defined as `Error.prototype.cause` and can be unset (i.e. not just `undefined`) if no cause was given: https://github.com/tc39/proposal-error-cause/issues/13, https://github.com/tc39/proposal-error-cause/issues/35.",
